WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.102
- In Hungary,

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:05.238 align:start size:81% position:19%
we were able to
unify these forces

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:09.175
through the lands of nation.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.644
If you love your country,

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.947
it doesn't matter whether
you are classical, liberal,

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:16.683 align:start size:88% position:13%
libertarian or
religious conservative,

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:21.688 align:start size:97% position:3%
then this is the point
where you have to be united

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:26.926
and you have to be able
to use your resources

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.829
against your political opponents

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:33.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they are using
everything what they have.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.169
The institutions, the state,

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:41.141 align:start size:97% position:3%
transnational organizations,
media, academia.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:46.346 align:start size:84% position:16%
And until that moment
we, on this side,

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.351
were just too silent
and too fragmented.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:55.055
(upbeat music)

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:00.326
- I'm Dave Rubin.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is "The Ruben Report"
from the local studio

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:04.030
right here in Miami.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.366
And joining me today is
the political director

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.235
for the Prime Minister
of Hungary, Polish Orban.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.737
Welcome to "The Ruben Report".

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.605
- Hi. Thank you very
much for inviting me.

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.507
- I am glad to have you here.

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.243
A freedom fighter
from across the way

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.847
here in America in the
free state of Florida.

00:01:20.847 --> 00:01:23.983
I was trying to think how I
wanted to do this interview

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:26.920
because I will be
very honest up top.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:29.155 align:start size:84% position:16%
I don't think
Americans know much,

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:30.790
if anything, about Hungary,

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I am not gonna pretend
to be a Hungary expert,

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.230
so I thought the best
way we could start this

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.765
was a little Hungary 101.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:41.334 align:start size:84% position:16%
If I say to you, tell
me about Hungary,

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:42.635
what does that mean to you?

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:48.141
- I think all the people of
United States and Florida

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:53.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
would love Hungary because
it's a small but old

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:58.251
central European country with
a thousand years old history.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.387
As you were referred,

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:05.425 align:start size:84% position:16%
we are known in Europe
as freedom fighters

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:09.195
because our history is about
constant fight for sovereignty.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:13.500
We were several times
occupied by foreigners

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.370
like the Ottomans, like the
Habsburgs or the Austrians,

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.873 align:start size:84% position:16%
like the Nazi Germans
and the Russians.

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:22.842
And we survived.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.879
And right now we
are proud members

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.850
of the European Union and
the Western community,

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:34.087
but we have our own values

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:37.223
and we are very proud
of our nationhood,

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:40.093
our country, our traditions.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:43.496
And that's the reason, I think,

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:47.400
why we came part of the
international debate,

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.003
at least inside the
western civilization,

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.938
about the future of
this civilization.

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.706
Which direction should we go

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:58.545 align:start size:84% position:16%
and if there is a dead
end street or not.

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:01.247
- So interestingly, the
guy that connected us

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:02.949
was my good friend
Peter Boghossian,

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:05.084
who has been on this
show many, many times,

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.920
who you've met a few times now.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.755
