to find it there.

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.005 align:start size:81% position:19%
- Yeah.
- Goes to Budapest

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.440
and he's finding it in Hungary.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.709 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah.
- That's interesting.

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:30.810
- He is a great guy.

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.449
Currently, we,

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:40.119
at least those who are working
for the Hungarian government

00:03:40.119 --> 00:03:43.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Prime Minister Orban,
we are conservatives.

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:44.924
We are Christian Democrats,

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:47.860
We are obviously representing
the political rights side.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.195
Out of question.

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:52.899 align:start position:0%
But according to our
understanding, it means freedom.

00:03:52.899 --> 00:03:54.067
Freedom of speech.

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.668
Freedom of thinking.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:57.170
Freedom of expression.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.973
And we have to preserve,

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:03.610
protect pluralism
in our society.

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:09.582 align:start size:97% position:3%
If Peter is there and he
speaks openly about his views,

00:04:09.582 --> 00:04:10.650
we can argue.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.585
We can debate with him.

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:15.388
Actually, we are
organizing debates

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:17.957
to show that these
are the alternatives.

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:20.693
Let the people choose.

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:22.895
And what he keeps telling to us

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:26.032 align:start size:84% position:16%
that it was the case
in United States.

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:30.136
It was the case in some other
western European countries.

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:34.474
But currently, this is
not the case anymore.

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:39.479
Leftist ideology wants
to control everything.

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:44.550 align:start size:88% position:13%
They want 100% power,
not separation of power.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:48.454 align:start size:88% position:13%
We, small central
European conservatives,

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:52.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
