getting higher and higher.

00:36:48.039 --> 00:36:51.142 align:start size:88% position:13%
And you have to buy
the energy from somehow

00:36:51.142 --> 00:36:53.811
because Europe is
not independent.

00:36:56.981 --> 00:36:58.749
If the energy prizes are high,

00:36:58.749 --> 00:37:01.852
then it immediately
causing inflation,

00:37:01.852 --> 00:37:04.255
