00:37:06.958 --> 00:37:11.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
If they close, then people
are losing their jobs.

00:37:11.295 --> 00:37:12.964
It's a process.

00:37:12.964 --> 00:37:17.969
It's a rational economical
process which is going on.

00:37:19.503 --> 00:37:23.140
According to our understanding,

00:37:23.140 --> 00:37:26.010
