the United States.

00:37:48.199 --> 00:37:53.037 align:start size:88% position:13%
There should be
Russian US peace talks.

00:37:53.037 --> 00:37:55.339 align:start size:84% position:16%
We would need
immediate ceasefire

00:37:55.339 --> 00:37:59.510
and try to cool
down the process.

