00:38:59.804 --> 00:39:02.640 align:start size:84% position:16%
But we should do the
other way around.

00:39:02.640 --> 00:39:04.542 align:start size:84% position:16%
The peace propaganda
should be started

00:39:04.542 --> 00:39:07.278
and spread everywhere.

00:39:07.278 --> 00:39:09.780
But we are not close to that.

00:39:09.780 --> 00:39:14.785
But unfortunately, the
winter will be very hard

00:39:16.220 --> 00:39:20.558 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I hope that sooner or
later everybody will realize

00:39:21.425 --> 00:39:23.361
that the prolongation of war,

00:39:23.361 --> 00:39:26.230
it's just not a good way to end.

00:39:26.230 --> 00:39:28.265
- What do you think the off
ramp looks like for Russia?

00:39:28.265 --> 00:39:30.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's something that they
could sit down and say,

00:39:30.267 --> 00:39:32.503
okay, we got this, we
can end this thing now?

00:39:33.838 --> 00:39:37.541
- I can have my own opinion.

00:39:37.541 --> 00:39:41.212 align:start size:88% position:13%
Hungarian leadership can
have its own opinion,

00:39:41.212 --> 00:39:44.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
but we are not a game
changer in this situation.

00:39:45.983 --> 00:39:47.752
It should be done
by the big players.

00:39:47.752 --> 00:39:49.787
We are just a small
mouse in the room.

00:39:49.787 --> 00:39:51.756 align:start size:84% position:16%
There are big
elephants in the room,

00:39:51.756 --> 00:39:54.191 align:start size:84% position:16%
they should make
their own decisions.

00:39:54.191 --> 00:39:58.195 align:start size:84% position:16%
But the problem is
that currently nobody,
as you mentioned,

00:39:58.195 --> 00:40:00.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
nobody's talking about
these kind of peace talks.

00:40:00.998 --> 00:40:04.935
Everybody's talking about
that we should keep going.

00:40:04.935 --> 00:40:07.037
We should go further.

00:40:07.872 --> 00:40:09.106
What is happening there.

00:40:09.106 --> 00:40:11.208
And the Ukrainians,

00:40:11.208 --> 00:40:16.213
they made just recently
a good counter strike,

00:40:17.381 --> 00:40:19.583
but then the Russians
made a counters strike.

00:40:21.652 --> 00:40:26.657 align:start size:97% position:3%
The whole story, from a
humanitarian point of view,

00:40:27.792 --> 00:40:30.795
it's getting even worse
and worse and worse.

00:40:30.795 --> 00:40:31.695
And we should stop that.

00:40:31.695 --> 00:40:33.197
- Yeah.

00:40:33.197 --> 00:40:34.465
I wasn't even planning on
mentioning this to you,

00:40:34.465 --> 00:40:36.801
but I guess what's sort
of sits with all of this

00:40:36.801 --> 00:40:39.904
is we have a major
censorship problem

00:40:39.904 --> 00:40:41.439
here in the United States

00:40:41.439 --> 00:40:42.973
and a completely, I would say,

00:40:42.973 --> 00:40:46.377 align:start size:97% position:3%
media that is in complete
dereliction of their duties,

00:40:46.377 --> 00:40:47.678
and deeply dishonest,

00:40:47.678 --> 00:40:49.680
and not friendly to
a lot of the ideas

00:40:49.680 --> 00:40:51.048
that we're discussing here.

00:40:51.048 --> 00:40:52.016
I'm curious on two things.

00:40:52.016 --> 00:40:54.351
How is your media generally?

00:40:55.219 --> 00:40:56.487
What about censorship,

00:40:56.487 --> 00:40:57.888
and what's going on
with the internet,

00:40:57.888 --> 00:40:59.557 align:start size:84% position:16%
and big tech and
all of those things,

00:40:59.557 --> 00:41:01.959 align:start size:97% position:3%
how much of that is an
important part of your world?

00:41:01.959 --> 00:41:04.895
- No, it's a very
important part.

00:41:04.895 --> 00:41:06.730
And from our perspective, media,

00:41:06.730 --> 00:41:08.432
it's a sovereignty issue again.

00:41:08.432 --> 00:41:10.701 align:start size:84% position:16%
So if media is
owned by foreigners,

00:41:10.701 --> 00:41:12.069
then foreigners are dictating

00:41:12.069 --> 00:41:14.438 align:start size:84% position:16%
what the Hungarians
should think.

00:41:14.438 --> 00:41:17.975 align:start size:84% position:16%
The first and foremost
important point

00:41:17.975 --> 00:41:22.980 align:start size:97% position:3%
is that at least the majority
of the Hungarian media

00:41:23.848 --> 00:41:25.249
should be owned by Hungarians.

00:41:25.249 --> 00:41:26.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
It doesn't matter whether
they are liberals,

00:41:26.517 --> 00:41:29.954
conservative socialists,
what ideology they have,

00:41:29.954 --> 00:41:33.257
but it should be in
a hand of Hungarians.

00:41:33.257 --> 00:41:34.725
In that sense,

00:41:34.725 --> 00:41:39.096 align:start size:97% position:3%
we are in a much better shape
than we were 12 years ago

00:41:40.397 --> 00:41:43.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
when the Orban government
came into power.

00:41:43.501 --> 00:41:48.472
The other thing is that
pluralism is important.

00:41:49.607 --> 00:41:53.611 align:start size:88% position:13%
The variety of opinions
should be visible,

00:41:55.045 --> 00:41:57.715
and Hungarian people should
make their own decision,

00:41:57.715 --> 00:42:01.952
which opinions they
they want to follow.

00:42:01.952 --> 00:42:03.187
And in this sense,

00:42:03.187 --> 00:42:04.989
I think the Hungarian
media is a better shape

00:42:04.989 --> 00:42:07.458
than the media in
western in Europe

00:42:07.458 --> 00:42:11.629
because the balance
between so-called...

00:42:11.629 --> 00:42:13.197 align:start size:97% position:3%
It's obviously
oversimplifying the things,

00:42:13.197 --> 00:42:16.133
but the liberal views and
the conservative views...

00:42:16.133 --> 00:42:19.169
The progressive liberal views
and the conservative views

00:42:19.169 --> 00:42:20.638
is it's quite balance.

00:42:20.638 --> 00:42:22.172
So it's 50, 50.

00:42:22.172 --> 00:42:23.407
- Interesting.

00:42:23.407 --> 00:42:26.076
And do you find you
have counterparts

00:42:26.076 --> 00:42:27.645
on the progressive liberal side

00:42:27.645 --> 00:42:29.980
that you can debate publicly

00:42:29.980 --> 00:42:31.882
or get into these
conversations with?

00:42:31.882 --> 00:42:34.351
Because that's what's going on
here, that's very difficult.

00:42:34.351 --> 00:42:36.687
They don't seem to
wanna debate anymore,

00:42:36.687 --> 00:42:38.355 align:start size:81% position:19%
or even have these
conversations.

00:42:40.291 --> 00:42:43.294
- Yeah, that's a good question.

00:42:43.294 --> 00:42:46.697
Sometimes they are on
board with the debate

00:42:46.697 --> 00:42:48.299
and they are available.

00:42:48.299 --> 00:42:51.936
But then they make a decision
if they're interested is that,

00:42:51.936 --> 00:42:53.537
and they close down everything

00:42:53.537 --> 00:42:54.972
and they are not communicating.

00:42:54.972 --> 00:42:56.240
- Well, because to be clear,

00:42:56.240 --> 00:42:57.875
whoever might be
the counterpart...

00:42:57.875 --> 00:42:59.810 align:start size:84% position:16%
I know you don't
have a counterpart on
the progressive side

00:42:59.810 --> 00:43:01.145
because they're not in
the government right now,

00:43:01.145 --> 00:43:03.347
but I would have that person on

00:43:03.347 --> 00:43:05.049 align:start size:81% position:19%
and treat them the
exact same way.

00:43:05.049 --> 00:43:07.351
But I suspect after
talking to someone

00:43:07.351 --> 00:43:08.852 align:start size:97% position:3%
with a last name Orban, that's
probably not gonna happen.

00:43:08.852 --> 00:43:10.487
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:43:12.189 --> 00:43:13.691
But, I think it's important.

00:43:13.691 --> 00:43:16.794
And we conservatives, or
the Hungarian right side,

00:43:16.794 --> 00:43:19.763
we are confident
because we think

00:43:19.763 --> 00:43:22.366
that the truth is on our side,

00:43:22.366 --> 00:43:25.769
so I am confident that I
can win all the debates.

00:43:27.972 --> 00:43:31.775
I'm always ready to
discuss these things.

00:43:31.775 --> 00:43:34.912
But their mindset
is a bit different.

00:43:34.912 --> 00:43:38.349
You mentioned the
big tech companies.

00:43:38.349 --> 00:43:42.486 align:start size:97% position:3%
They are playing an even
more and more important role

00:43:42.486 --> 00:43:45.789
in Hungarian public sphere.

00:43:47.124 --> 00:43:50.861 align:start position:0%
And the censorship is obviously
an issue there as well.

00:43:50.861 --> 00:43:54.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
Our situation is even
worse than your situation

00:43:54.465 --> 00:43:57.935
because those tech companies,

00:44:00.004 --> 00:44:03.374
their headquarter is
in the United States

00:44:03.374 --> 00:44:05.676
or in another European country,

00:44:05.676 --> 00:44:09.246
so we don't have
those companies.

00:44:09.246 --> 00:44:13.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
What was done by, for
example, Governor DeSantis

00:44:14.551 --> 00:44:17.921 align:start size:84% position:16%
that through taxation
and through some
legislative actions,

00:44:19.857 --> 00:44:24.094
he wanted to create
a fair treatment

00:44:24.094 --> 00:44:25.963
for all the political opinions.

00:44:27.364 --> 00:44:30.534 align:start position:0%
We Hungarians and the other
small center European countries,

00:44:32.036 --> 00:44:34.672 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm not saying we
are, we are toolless,

00:44:34.672 --> 00:44:36.540
but we don't have as much tools

00:44:36.540 --> 00:44:38.976
as you have here in
the United States.

00:44:38.976 --> 00:44:41.045
That's why for us it's important

00:44:41.045 --> 00:44:45.616
that the Republicans are
pushing this thing forward

00:44:45.616 --> 00:44:49.720
because otherwise it
will have an effect

00:44:49.720 --> 00:44:53.991
on the other European
countries as well.

00:44:53.991 --> 00:44:55.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
- What level of censorship
do you guys think

00:44:55.893 --> 00:44:57.194
you're dealing with?

00:44:57.194 --> 00:44:58.462
It's almost impossible to tell

00:44:58.462 --> 00:44:59.930 align:start size:84% position:16%
because once you're
being censored,

00:44:59.930 --> 00:45:02.266 align:start size:97% position:3%
and throttled, and all of
those things, you don't know.

00:45:02.266 --> 00:45:05.469
But I would imagine
if the Prime Minister

00:45:05.469 --> 00:45:07.438
was to put out something

00:45:07.438 --> 00:45:08.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they could even
frame as anti-immigrant...

00:45:08.806 --> 00:45:10.040 align:start size:84% position:16%
And I've read a
lot of his speeches

00:45:10.040 --> 00:45:11.842
where they go completely insane,

00:45:11.842 --> 00:45:13.243
call him racist and
all of these things.

00:45:13.243 --> 00:45:14.178
And if you read it,

00:45:14.178 --> 00:45:15.345
it's actually quite measured

00:45:15.345 --> 00:45:17.381 align:start size:84% position:16%
and sort of what
you've laid out here.

00:45:17.381 --> 00:45:19.083 align:start size:84% position:16%
Can you even tell what
level of censorship

00:45:19.083 --> 00:45:20.384
you're dealing with?

00:45:24.054 --> 00:45:27.324 align:start size:97% position:3%
- It's not as bad as it
happened in the United States

00:45:27.324 --> 00:45:31.028
that the one platform
banned the president.

00:45:31.028 --> 00:45:32.496
- And then everyone banned him.

00:45:32.496 --> 00:45:35.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Yeah, and then everyone
banned the president.

00:45:37.267 --> 00:45:39.002
It did not happen yet.

00:45:40.738 --> 00:45:43.340
But I experienced

00:45:43.340 --> 00:45:46.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
as well as a politician
and some other politicians

00:45:46.143 --> 00:45:48.245
also experienced that.

00:45:48.245 --> 00:45:50.748
And we know that those people

00:45:50.748 --> 00:45:53.350
who are in charge of making
these kind of decisions,

00:45:53.350 --> 00:45:55.586
they are not accountable.

00:45:55.586 --> 00:45:57.921
But we know them,

00:45:58.989 --> 00:46:02.059 align:start size:88% position:13%
and from an ideological
perspective,

00:46:02.059 --> 00:46:05.062 align:start size:88% position:13%
their opinion is
obviously not balanced.

00:46:08.432 --> 00:46:10.634
And making these
kind of decisions

00:46:10.634 --> 00:46:12.970
shouldn't be made by
private companies.

00:46:12.970 --> 00:46:16.707
It's so simple and it's
not a brand new issue.

00:46:16.707 --> 00:46:20.878
It wasn't invented, this
thought, just recently.

00:46:20.878 --> 00:46:24.681
It's well known for centuries

00:46:24.681 --> 00:46:26.984
and thousands and
thousands of years,

00:46:26.984 --> 00:46:30.020 align:start size:88% position:13%
that these kind of
decisions should be made

00:46:30.020 --> 00:46:32.356
by independent branches.

00:46:32.356 --> 00:46:37.361 align:start size:97% position:3%
That's why we invented the
idea of independent judiciary.

00:46:38.829 --> 00:46:42.332
And currently, the role of
the independent judiciary

00:46:42.332 --> 00:46:47.337 align:start position:0%
is done by these private company
censorship group of people.

00:46:49.306 --> 00:46:50.774
I think it's nonsense,

00:46:50.774 --> 00:46:55.445
but I'm quite optimistic
because through the history

00:46:56.513 --> 00:46:58.849 align:start size:84% position:16%
of the technological
development,

00:46:58.849 --> 00:47:01.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
when the all the new
platforms were coming in,

00:47:01.919 --> 00:47:05.656
first radio, and then
the television, and
then the internet,

00:47:05.656 --> 00:47:08.192
and then right now
the social media.

00:47:09.393 --> 00:47:10.794
There was always,
at the beginning,

00:47:10.794 --> 00:47:12.062
a kind of a turbulent time,

00:47:12.062 --> 00:47:15.332 align:start size:81% position:19%
when the state
made the takeover,

00:47:15.332 --> 00:47:20.337 align:start size:97% position:3%
so it does not mean that there
should be state censorship,

00:47:21.205 --> 00:47:23.774
but through legislative power,

00:47:23.774 --> 00:47:25.976
at least some fair balance

00:47:25.976 --> 00:47:28.879 align:start size:84% position:16%
should be immediately
established.

00:47:28.879 --> 00:47:31.982 align:start size:97% position:3%
And they did with the
radio, with the television,

00:47:31.982 --> 00:47:33.317
with all the platforms.

00:47:33.317 --> 00:47:35.118
Just took couple years.

00:47:35.118 --> 00:47:36.553
- Right.

00:47:36.553 --> 00:47:38.856
- I hope it's gonna happen too.

00:47:38.856 --> 00:47:40.090
- But when you say you
hope it's gonna happen,

00:47:40.090 --> 00:47:41.558
do you mean from
an American side,

00:47:41.558 --> 00:47:42.993
because these are American
companies, for the most part,

00:47:42.993 --> 00:47:45.495 align:start position:0%
that you want something to
happen on the legislative side?

00:47:45.495 --> 00:47:46.997
- Yeah, yeah.

00:47:46.997 --> 00:47:51.134
- I hate to tell you, my
friend, I don't think so.

00:47:52.336 --> 00:47:55.505
- Or at least in Europe

00:47:55.505 --> 00:47:58.442
because probably we Hungarians,

00:47:58.442 --> 00:48:00.010 align:start size:84% position:16%
we are just small
players in that issue,

00:48:00.010 --> 00:48:03.680
but Europe as such
is 27 countries.

00:48:05.415 --> 00:48:07.251 align:start size:88% position:13%
This is something which
should be discussed

00:48:07.251 --> 00:48:11.321
on the European level and
we should act together.

00:48:11.321 --> 00:48:13.924
But until that moment
it did not happen.

00:48:13.924 --> 00:48:15.592
- I normally don't end
on a question like this,

00:48:15.592 --> 00:48:18.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
but is there anything else
that you wanna hit on?

00:48:18.562 --> 00:48:20.731
I think we hit most
of the big stuff.

00:48:20.731 --> 00:48:22.499
You're here in town in Miami

00:48:22.499 --> 00:48:24.101 align:start size:88% position:13%
for the National
Conservatism Conference,

00:48:24.101 --> 00:48:25.269
as we talked about,

00:48:25.269 --> 00:48:26.570 align:start size:88% position:13%
and that that's ongoing
for a couple days.

00:48:26.570 --> 00:48:28.372
And they're trying to
hash out all the things

00:48:28.372 --> 00:48:30.274
that we've discussed.

00:48:30.274 --> 00:48:32.376
Did you hear anything
else interesting there

00:48:32.376 --> 00:48:34.778
that is on your mind
or relevant to Hungary?

00:48:34.778 --> 00:48:36.747
Or have you been
shocked by anything

00:48:36.747 --> 00:48:38.849
since you've been here
in the United States?

00:48:38.849 --> 00:48:40.584 align:start size:84% position:16%
It worse than you
thought? Is it better?

00:48:40.584 --> 00:48:44.121
- No, no, no, because all the
Americans I know and I like,

00:48:44.121 --> 00:48:47.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
they are anti woke and
they are very nice people.

00:48:47.090 --> 00:48:49.359
And they are very
nice to my country.

00:48:49.359 --> 00:48:51.061 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Yeah, yeah, you
should go to Portland,

00:48:51.061 --> 00:48:52.296
see what's happening.

00:48:52.296 --> 00:48:54.865
- Yeah the situation
is different for sure.

00:48:56.066 --> 00:49:00.637
But I have to say that
always I come to here,

00:49:02.940 --> 00:49:05.575
I become more optimistic.

00:49:05.575 --> 00:49:10.213
I know that you are
also serious trouble.

00:49:10.213 --> 00:49:14.251 align:start size:84% position:16%
But if I keep
talking with people,

00:49:14.251 --> 00:49:19.256 align:start position:0%
the idea of American greatness,
it emerges immediately.

00:49:21.058 --> 00:49:23.760 align:start size:81% position:19%
And I think at
the end of the day

00:49:24.828 --> 00:49:26.363
you will figure out something.

00:49:26.363 --> 00:49:29.166
The only thing I keep
telling them that,

00:49:29.166 --> 00:49:31.969
I know that America is special.

00:49:31.969 --> 00:49:35.305
I know that it's
like an elephant

00:49:36.773 --> 00:49:39.876
and all the others are just
smaller animals around you,

00:49:39.876 --> 00:49:41.111
even the Europeans.

00:49:41.111 --> 00:49:43.747 align:start size:88% position:13%
But there are some small
animals, some mouses,

00:49:43.747 --> 00:49:46.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
and sometimes the smaller
animals, the mouses,

00:49:46.650 --> 00:49:50.587 align:start size:84% position:16%
also can help the
elephants to survive.

00:49:50.587 --> 00:49:55.592
These kind of alliance can be
beneficial for most parties.

00:49:56.927 --> 00:49:58.195
- That was a beautiful ending,

00:49:58.195 --> 00:50:00.197
however I did say to you
right before we started,

00:50:00.197 --> 00:50:02.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said, this is a
beautiful cover of a book.

00:50:02.165 --> 00:50:05.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
The book is "The Hungarian
Way Of Strategy".

00:50:05.335 --> 00:50:07.804
Can you just tell the
people what this elk

00:50:07.804 --> 00:50:09.606
on the front of the book is?

00:50:09.606 --> 00:50:11.975
- It's an elk or stag,

00:50:11.975 --> 00:50:14.945
and the idea, according
to Hungarian history,

00:50:14.945 --> 00:50:16.546
the Hungarian tribes,

00:50:16.546 --> 00:50:18.815
seven tribes who
occupied the land

00:50:18.815 --> 00:50:23.420 align:start size:88% position:13%
where we are living more
than 1,100 years ago.

00:50:23.420 --> 00:50:28.425 align:start size:84% position:16%
They were led by this
special creature.

00:50:31.395 --> 00:50:36.400
She was the one who
was doing the lead.

00:50:37.634 --> 00:50:40.003
And through this animal,

00:50:40.003 --> 00:50:44.941
a transcendent power or
God was leading the way.

00:50:44.941 --> 00:50:46.410
The idea of the cover

00:50:46.410 --> 00:50:50.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
is that this stag is
still here, still with us,

00:50:50.347 --> 00:50:55.318
so the future is not
so pessimistic for us.

00:50:56.219 --> 00:50:57.087
- Now that counts as an ending.

00:50:57.087 --> 00:50:58.255
- Thank you very much.

00:50:58.255 --> 00:50:58.955 align:start size:84% position:16%
- My pleasure.
- Thank you very much.

00:50:58.955 --> 00:51:00.424
